{"source":"BMKG — Peringatan Dini Cuaca (nowcast)","feed":"https://www.bmkg.go.id/alerts/nowcast/id/rss.xml","checkedAt":"2026-09-23T15:04:52.277Z","alerts":[{"id":"2.49.0.1.360.0.2026.09.23.15.14.004","link":"https://www.bmkg.go.id/alerts/nowcast/id/CRU20260923004_alert.xml","event":"Hujan Lebat dan Petir","headline":"Hujan Lebat disertai Petir di Riau","description":"Hujan lebat disertai petir akan terjadi pada 23 September 2026, 21:45 WIB di sebagian wilayah Riau, khususnya di BAGAN SINEMBAH, BANGKO PUSAKO, BONAI DARUSSALAM, KABUN, KANDIS, KEPENUHAN, KUNTO DARUSSALAM, LIMA PULUH, MANDAU, MANDAU, MINAS, PAYUNG SEKAKI, PEKANBARU KOTA, PENDALIAN IV KOTO, PINGGIR, PUJUD, RANTAU KOPAR, ROKAN IV KOTO, RUMBAI, RUMBAI PESISIR, SENAPELAN, TAMBUSAI UTARA, TANAH PUTIH, TANDUN, TAPUNG, TAPUNG HILIR, TAPUNG HULU.\n Kondisi ini berpotensi menimbulkan dampak berupa jarak pandang berkurang, angin kencang, dan banjir lokal.\n Masyarakat dihimbau untuk tetap waspada, mengurangi aktivitas di luar ruangan, serta mengambil langkah-langkah pencegahan yang diperlukan guna menjaga keselamatan.\n Kondisi diperkirakan dapat berlangsung hingga 24 September 2026, 00:30 WIB.","impact":"jarak pandang berkurang, angin kencang, dan banjir lokal","severity":"Moderate","urgency":"Immediate","certainty":"Observed","sent":1790174100000,"effective":1790174700000,"expires":1790184600000,"infographic":"https://nowcasting.bmkg.go.id/infografis/CRU/2026/09/23/infografis.jpg","province":"Riau","districts":{"primary":["BAGAN SINEMBAH","BANGKO PUSAKO","BONAI DARUSSALAM","KABUN","KANDIS","KEPENUHAN","KUNTO DARUSSALAM","LIMA PULUH","MANDAU","MANDAU","MINAS","PAYUNG SEKAKI","PEKANBARU KOTA","PENDALIAN IV KOTO","PINGGIR","PUJUD","RANTAU KOPAR","ROKAN IV KOTO","RUMBAI","RUMBAI PESISIR","SENAPELAN","TAMBUSAI UTARA","TANAH PUTIH","TANDUN","TAPUNG","TAPUNG HILIR","TAPUNG HULU"],"extended":[]},"polygons":[[[0.618,101.341],[0.606,101.328],[0.591,101.329],[0.566,101.354],[0.561,101.369],[0.554,101.375],[0.536,101.363